; Property fuzzing for the parsers and the two pure state machines.
;
; Crowbar generates structured input and shrinks a failure to something a human
; can read. Under an ordinary switch these run as bounded randomised tests,
; which is what CI does; under an AFL-instrumented switch the same executables
; are afl-fuzz targets. Building them both ways from one source is the point --
; a fuzz target that only exists on a special switch stops compiling and nobody
; notices.
;
; See ../docs/fuzzing.md for how to run these properly.

(executables
 (names
  fuzz_address
  fuzz_raw_data
  fuzz_http
  fuzz_json
  fuzz_signature
  fuzz_submission)
 (libraries
  tron-types
  tron-crypto
  tron-transaction
  tron-proto
  tron-rpc
  tron-rpc-flow
  web3-codec-protobuf
  digestif
  yojson
  crowbar))
